OL,3,GNEWSAVets can diagnose bluetongue to
OL,4,Acut test delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FVets will now be able to diagnose
OL,7,Fbluetongue virus in livestock so
OL,8,Ffarmers do not have to wait for
OL,9,Fconfirmed test results under changes
OL,10,Fannounced by the government.
OL,12,FThe potentially deadly virus, which
OL,13,Faffects sheep and cattle as well as
OL,14,Fother animals, continues to spread with
OL,15,Fconfirmed cases on 1,048 farms in the
OL,16,FUK - more than half are in Devon and
OL,17,FCornwall.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
