OL,3,GNEWSAVets can diagnose bluetongue to
OL,4,Acut test delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers previously needed to wait for
OL,7,Fsamples to be sent to a laboratory to
OL,8,Fconfirm bluetongue but the government
OL,9,Fsaid vets would now be able to diagnose
OL,10,Fthe disease after examining the
OL,11,Fanimals.
OL,13,FUK deputy chief veterinary officer Ele
OL,14,FBrown said: "Bluetongue is widely
OL,15,Fcirculating in England and our approach
OL,16,Fneeds to keep pace."
